      <div class="col card challenge"><h3>2) Heterogeneous lengths</h3><p>Short and long responses require different bias-variance tradeoffs for advantage estimation.</p></div>
      <div class="col card challenge"><h3>3) Reward sparsity</h3><p>Sparse outcomes in long CoT reduce learning signal density and slow optimization.</p></div>
